# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in real values.
# .env.secrets is gitignored and overrides configs/jdownloader2/.env.
# Empty: WEB_AUTHENTICATION_USERNAME/PASSWORD are supplied as compose secrets
# and read directly by patches/jdownloader2/10-webauth.sh, which replaces
# the image's own cont-init.d script (its documented CONT_ENV_<VAR>
# Docker-secrets support does not actually work in this image; see the
# comment in docker-compose-torrent.yml and docs/COMPOSE_CONVENTIONS.md).
# See configs/jdownloader2/secrets/.
